CORE
main.py
--unwind 5
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
String equality of constant operands (cprover_string_equal_func over
`{length, &literal[0]}`) is folded during symbolic execution, and the
address of a constant array literal propagates as a constant. Before, the
filter stayed symbolic, every drain loop was unwound in full, and this did
not finish in minutes at the bound needed.
